OTOGAKURE OPERATIONS — MISSION DEBRIEF
STATUS: COMPLETED (objective secured)
Op Ref: OP-SR-410 "Bring Him In"

Objective
Escort the defector Sasuke Uchiha from the Hidden Leaf to the Sound compound. The subject
is the designated preferred vessel; his safe arrival supersedes all other considerations.

Detail
The Sound Five were dispatched to receive the subject at the border and repel Leaf
pursuit. The subject traveled sealed within the transport barrel for the assimilation of
his cursed seal en route.

Engagements
The Leaf mounted a retrieval squad. Each of the Five engaged a pursuer to hold the line:
- Jirobo — fell in engagement.
- Kidomaru — fell in engagement.
- Sakon/Ukon — fell in engagement.
- Tayuya — fell in engagement.
- Kimimaro (recalled from the medic ward) intercepted the final pursuer and held until his
  illness overcame him.

Outcome
The subject reached the compound. The cost was the whole of the Sound Five. Their loss is
recorded with the understanding that the vessel was worth it. Subject placed under Lord
Orochimaru's direct tutelage pending the transfer schedule.
